@startuml
' PaymentArch · 03 Payment Components（C4 Level 3 —— 仅 payment-service）—— 结构视图：不画连线
' SOURCE OF TRUTH = 本 .puml；同目录 03-payment-components.svg 为渲染产物，禁止手工编辑。
' 渲染：cd docs/architecture/diagrams && java -jar ../../../deployment/output/tools/plantuml.jar -tsvg -charset UTF-8 03-payment-components.puml
' 规范：docs/standards/diagram-standard.md（结构视图 MUST NOT 画可见连线；-[hidden]- 仅用于排版）
' 依据：docs/architecture/systems/payment-service.md §1.1 / §2.1.1 / §4（ADR-0072 / 0073 / 0075 / 0076）
' 排版：层内同级节点 -[hidden]right- 排成一行；层与层 -[hidden]down- 声明自上而下的依赖层序。

title PaymentArch · L3 Component —— payment-service 内部有架构意义的组件（结构视图 · 不表达调用关系）

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam Padding 10
skinparam Nodesep 12
skinparam Ranksep 18
skinparam roundcorner 10

skinparam rectangle {
  BorderThickness 1
  FontSize 11
}
skinparam rectangle<<layer>> {
  BackgroundColor #F2F2EF
  BorderColor #B4B2A9
  FontSize 12
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam rectangle<<payment>> {
  BackgroundColor #DCE6F2
  BorderColor #5B7DA8
}
skinparam rectangle<<channel>> {
  BackgroundColor #D7E9F5
  BorderColor #5B7DA8
}
skinparam rectangle<<port>> {
  BackgroundColor #EDEDED
  BorderColor #5B7DA8
}
skinparam rectangle<<domain>> {
  BackgroundColor #E4E0F0
  BorderColor #7B6FA8
}
skinparam rectangle<<ext>> {
  BackgroundColor #E8E8E8
  BorderColor #A0A0A0
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #D7E9F5
  BorderColor #5B7DA8
  FontSize 11
}

' ============ 1. api 接入层 ============
package "api 接入层" as API {
  rectangle "PaymentController\nHTTP 入口 / DTO 转换" as C1 <<payment>>
}

' ============ 2. application 支付层 ============
package "application 应用层（payment 支付层 —— 管 payments 表的资金动作状态）" as APP {
  rectangle "PaymentApplicationService\n支付意图编排 / 选路 / 建单 / 应用结果" as A1 <<payment>>
  rectangle "PaymentPersistence\npayments 表唯一写入口\n（建单 + 结果应用，本地事务）" as A2 <<payment>>
  rectangle "PaymentResultApplier\n双状态机驱动（payment / attempt）" as A3 <<payment>>
  rectangle "PaymentCallbackService\nPaymentUnknownResolutionService\n回调收敛 / UNKNOWN 收敛" as A4 <<payment>>
  rectangle "PaymentRefundService\n退款域（原 refund-service，ADR-0064）" as A5 <<payment>>
  rectangle "LimitGate\n用户支付限额两阶段预占（spec 027）" as A6 <<payment>>
  A1 -[hidden]right- A2
  A2 -[hidden]right- A3
  A3 -[hidden]right- A4
  A4 -[hidden]right- A5
  A5 -[hidden]right- A6
}

' ============ 3. channelgateway.application 渠道网关层 ============
package "channelgateway.application —— 渠道网关域（spec 038：独立顶层包；payment 层只依赖这里的接口抽象，Payment ≠ Channel）" as PORTS {
  rectangle "PaymentChannel\n渠道交互端口" as P1 <<port>>
  rectangle "ChannelRouter\n前向选路（确定性，读 channel_code 枚举）" as P2 <<port>>
  rectangle "ChannelRegistry\n渠道身份注册表（按 channel_code 解析）" as P3 <<port>>
  rectangle "ChannelOrderService\nchannel_orders 表唯一写入口" as P4 <<port>>
  P1 -[hidden]right- P2
  P2 -[hidden]right- P3
  P3 -[hidden]right- P4
}

' ============ 4. application.reliability ============
package "application.reliability 可靠性" as REL {
  rectangle "PaymentRetryService\n渠道通信退避重试（同 attempt 重放）" as R1 <<payment>>
  rectangle "TimeoutScanner\nPROCESSING / UNKNOWN 超时扫描" as R2 <<payment>>
  R1 -[hidden]right- R2
}

' ============ 5. domain 领域层 ============
package "domain 领域层（聚合根 / 状态机 / 不变式）" as DOM {
  rectangle "Payment（聚合根）\n状态机 / 幂等键 / 金额口径" as D1 <<domain>>
  rectangle "ChannelOrder（聚合根）\n渠道单生命周期 / channelMode 派生" as D2 <<domain>>
  D1 -[hidden]right- D2
}

' ============ 6. infra.channel 渠道实现族 ============
package "infra.channel 渠道实现族（依赖倒置：实现 application.channel 端口）" as IMPL {
  rectangle "AbstractMockChannelAdapter\n模板方法：编排 + MOCK 模拟语义" as I1 <<channel>>
  rectangle "MockChannelAdapter\nWechatChannelAdapter\nDouyinChannelAdapter" as I2 <<channel>>
  rectangle "AlipayChannelAdapter\nsupportsRealMode() = true（SANDBOX）" as I3 <<channel>>
  rectangle "AlipayGateway\n收口 alipay-sdk-java（SDK 不外泄）" as I4 <<channel>>
  I1 -[hidden]right- I2
  I2 -[hidden]right- I3
  I3 -[hidden]right- I4
}

' ============ 7. infra.persistence 持久化 ============
package "infra.persistence 持久化（依赖倒置：实现 domain 仓储 + 渠道层端口）" as IMPP {
  rectangle "MybatisPaymentRepository\n实现 domain 仓储接口" as J1 <<channel>>
  rectangle "ChannelOrderServiceImpl\n实现 ChannelOrderService 端口" as J2 <<channel>>
  J1 -[hidden]right- J2
}

' ============ 8. 本服务之外的依赖对象 ============
package "外部容器 / 外部系统（本服务的上下游）" as EXTS {
  rectangle "order-service\n[Container]" as ORD <<ext>>
  rectangle "ledger-service\n[Container]" as LED <<ext>>
  rectangle "支付宝开放平台（沙箱）\n[External System]" as ALI <<ext>>
  ORD -[hidden]right- LED
  LED -[hidden]right- ALI
}

package "本服务数据表（每张表只有一个写入口）" as TABS {
  database "payments\n只由 payment 支付层写\n（PaymentPersistence）" as DB1
  database "channel_orders\n只由 channelgateway 渠道网关层写\n（ChannelOrderService）" as DB2
  DB1 -[hidden]right- DB2
}

' ==== 仅用于排版的隐藏连接（渲染不可见，不表达任何关系）====
API -[hidden]down- APP
APP -[hidden]down- PORTS
PORTS -[hidden]down- REL
REL -[hidden]down- DOM
DOM -[hidden]down- IMPL
IMPL -[hidden]down- IMPP
IMPP -[hidden]down- EXTS
EXTS -[hidden]down- TABS

legend bottom left
  **Legend**
  蓝灰 = payment 支付层组件 ｜ **淡紫 = domain 领域层（聚合根）** ｜ 浅蓝 = channelgateway 渠道网关层 / 持久化实现 ｜ 浅灰 = 端口（interface）｜ 灰 = 外部容器 / 系统
  ★ **结构视图：不画任何连线。** 依赖关系由**自上而下的层序**表达，不用箭头。
  ★ 依赖方向铁律：api → application → domain ← infra（依赖倒置，infra 实现 domain 与端口）
    · **application 包 MUST NOT 依赖 infra.channel**（ArchUnit **INV-4 / INV-5**）
    · channel_orders 写入口唯一 = ChannelOrderService；payments 写入口唯一 = PaymentPersistence
  ★ 运行期调用顺序见 [04-payment-flow] / [05-payment-unknown-recovery] / [06-refund-flow]
endlegend

@enduml
